{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_085AF0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"堪称Snake左右手的Miller，似乎有个不太好的毛病。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"他总会立刻对身边的女人下手。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"也许十几岁的少女不在他的目标范围内，所以他倒没对我做过什么……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"不过作为替代，他似乎把Mother Base里为数不多的女兵一个个都搭讪了个遍。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":98,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"那些女人也是，明明不理他就好了，却总是轻易上钩。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"问题的根源，也许就在于那种男人偏偏长得还不赖。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"今天，Miller这个坏毛病似乎又惹出了麻烦。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"我亲眼撞见了Snake和Miller难得吵架的场面。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":56,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"两人从淋浴间出来时，竟然全身赤裸地扭打在一起。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"我也不是看到男人裸体就会脸红的小孩子了，可这一幕还是让我吃了一惊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"Snake一边喊着“这下该让你长点记性了！”，一边挥拳打向Miller的胸口。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"后来我才听说，似乎是Miller脚踏两条船，其中一名女兵为这事找Snake商量。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":98,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"要我说，这种事被骗的女人也有错。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"连Miller根本没有诚意都看不出来，作为女人未免太没水准。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"不过这种事似乎已经发生过很多次，连Snake这次都忍不住警告了Miller。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":92,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"Miller却顶了回去，后来两人互相骂了起来，最后似乎就发展成了拳脚相向。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"“你小子敢打我！”Miller也挥拳还击Snake。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":56,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"Snake笑着说“这一拳不错”，又说“但对我没用”，随即转而反击。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"看来他们在淋浴间里就已经打得相当激烈，两人身上早已满是淤青。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"他们的身体都是为战斗锻炼出来的，可以说全身上下都是武器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"光是这样互殴，两人身上就已经到处流血。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"不过，要是他们真的动真格，绝不会只有这种程度。若使出全力，显然必有一人会死。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"“那这招怎么样！”Miller再次挥拳。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"Snake也一拳打了回去。不过，他果然还是避开了要害。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"“不愧是你啊，Boss……”Miller一边调整呼吸一边低声说道，脸上也浮现出笑容。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":106,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"之后，两人又继续互殴了一阵。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"汗水飞溅，鲜血从皮肤上渗出。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"没有杀意，也没有憎恨的互殴。我从未见过这样的暴力。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"但他们也并非只是在打闹，而是使尽彼此掌握的技术认真交手。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"明明不像体育运动那样有规则，他们究竟为什么能做到这种事？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"这场奇妙的战斗，最终在两人都筋疲力尽后才终于结束。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"看着对方遍体鳞伤的样子，两人不约而同地放声大笑，随后抱在一起，称赞彼此打得不错。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":32,"cn_text":"我只觉得他们像两个笨蛋。我无法理解他们的心情。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":33,"cn_text":"可不知为什么，我忽然觉得，那个出了名好色的Miller，真正信任的人大概只有Snake。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":110,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":34,"cn_text":"像我这样的人，大概不可能插进他们两人之间。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":35,"cn_text":"这么一想，我竟有种自己输了的感觉。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""}]}